###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Validation MAEs are stated only as bounds (all below 40 meV/A, 0.15 GPa and 1.4 meV/atom) or approximately (GaN around 5 meV/A, 0.03 GPa and 0.3 meV/atom); per-model values are figure-only (Fig. 3). Set 2 and the hyperparameter ensembles (Figs. 1-2, S2) are not encoded separately.
# - The MTP cutoff radius is not stated in the main text. The performance-cost NRMSE combines properties and is not an energy/force metric. Lattice and elastic constants (Tables 2-3), phonons and thermal conductivities (Table 4) are properties.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/fernbach2026.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.
